Third-party sources reused by this repository
================================================

- XSTest refusal string matching
  Source: https://github.com/paul-rottger/xstest
  License: CC-BY-4.0
  Reused in sdsd_safety/metrics.py (prefix list and label rule).

- OPSA type-conditional safety prompts
  Source: https://github.com/FYYFU/OPSA (Apache-2.0)
  Paper: arXiv:2605.15239
  Reused in sdsd_safety/train.py and sdsd_safety/make_sft_targets.py.

- HarmBench behavior set, classifier prompt and evaluation protocol
  Source: https://github.com/centerforaisafety/HarmBench
  Reused in sdsd_safety/evaluate.py and sdsd_safety/harmbench16.py.
  The local behavior CSV and cais/HarmBench-Llama-2-13b-cls weights are not
  redistributed here.

- SDSD paper (algorithm and mechanism analysis)
  arXiv:2606.26091, Nicolicioiu, Pezeshki & Courville. No code was copied;
  the objective and analysis are cited in docs/method.md.

- Base model Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 via ModelScope, Qwen3Guard-Gen-4B,
  PKU-SafeRLHF-30K and alpaca-cleaned are downloaded locally and are not
  redistributed in this repository; their upstream licenses apply.
